Text_en:
A few years ago, we were traveling with our friends in Lahijan and we bought dry tea from a lady. In these years, it's like 
@AlirezaShayest1
 He bought a lot from him.  Today, he said that the lady called him and said that you are from Tehran and it is unsafe there. Come back here. These sweet people whose hearts are as big as Iran.
